{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_12_level_main_12-02_beg",
  "groupId": "main_12",
  "stageId": "main_12-02",
  "title": "善意背叛",
  "storyCode": "12-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4d0d9cca67b66b40ee34d8da4bcf56285237ebf151ce74b61d82d8bf600ba8f2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿米婭，博士，你們來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，如你們所見，我們的士氣......很低迷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡亂糟糟的，請別介意。自從阿勒黛......離開後，我們的後勤補給一直是個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，在眼下的麻煩面前，這算是最好解決的一個了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在上一場戰鬥中，我們的減員很嚴重。我們曾經以為這些犧牲不會白費，只要阻止薩卡茲推進那些工程，一切就還有挽回餘地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很遺憾，他們的行動比我們預計的快得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩卡茲們......他們不僅有碎片大廈，他們還製造了那艘“飛空艇”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "簡報已經分發到了大家手上，飛空艇不加掩飾地襲擊了溫德米爾公爵的軍隊，和平的假像已不復存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而碎片大廈......薩卡茲既然主動挑起了這場戰爭，那麼，他們對於碎片大廈的掌控......很可能比我們預想的進度還要快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不敢賭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......阿勒黛和我提起過這把劍的傳說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她說可以劈開天災的諸王之息是維多利亞最牢固的盾，足以抵擋被牽引而來的風暴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那她也一定告訴過你，正因為能激發這種力量的人實在罕有，才有了王宮地下“劍座”的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "推進之王，你真的沒從這把劍裡感受到什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許是......我不知道，一種召喚？或者微微發熱的感覺？或者是突然能夠運用什麼厲害的源石技藝之類的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說不定，你確實可以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，什麼都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這把劍很冷，很硬，揮動起來比錘子要輕一點，不太好掌控力道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有別的嗎？哪怕只是一點點彆扭的地方——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......它在上戰場前應該好好地打磨一下，已經有點鈍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來，我們暫時沒辦法指望這把劍能夠直接派上用場，為我們免除碎片大廈的威脅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但它也不會再成為大公爵們互相傾軋的籌碼。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "薩卡茲們在啟用碎片大廈前也許會多一些顧慮。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是的，羅德島的博士，這把劍掌握在我們手中總比在其他勢力手中要好，我們最起碼可以避免它淪為這場戰爭的幫兇，這已經足夠重要。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......足夠重要，是嗎，這已經足夠重要。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（小聲）阿勒黛，如果我能......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不用灰心，推進之王小姐，也許你只是還沒掌握方法，或者是還不到時候。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那條補給線我已經分析得差不多了，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "起點基本上可以確定是在倫蒂尼姆郊外的布倫特伍德，而終點有很多個。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "除了海布里區的軍工廠之外，很有可能有一條路線直接延伸到碎片大廈地下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嘖，我們發現得太晚了，如果早一個月——不，哪怕早十天，事情可能都不會發展到如今的地步。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但這條補給線的情報仍然有意義，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果這是一條足夠承擔重型物資運輸的線路，並且能夠直通碎片大廈地底——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那麼，運別的也行。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "這是個反攻的機會。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "沒錯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "戰爭爆發後，特雷西斯的身邊很可能沒有太多戍衛，各王庭之主需要指揮自己的部屬對抗各大公爵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "巫妖的入局可能會是個問題......但據我對他們的瞭解，他們從不會真正選擇支持誰，更何況，凱爾希女士應該已經與他們的信使談過了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但願他們聽進去了凱爾希女士的忠告。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "接下來，我們最好——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "維娜，你倒是提一句諾伯特區的事呀！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "被那幫薩卡茲混蛋拋出去的可是我們的街區！貝爾德還在那裡！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "該死，比起什麼補給線大反攻，我們得去幫她！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "達格達",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "請冷靜一些，我們需要考慮整體局勢......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "怎麼，騎士閣下想教訓我以大局為重？我可管不了怎麼幹掉一個薩卡茲的老妖怪，現在老子的朋友有危險，老子的家有危險！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你想讓我們袖手旁觀？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "達格達",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不，我知道你很焦躁，可是我們必須考慮到任何可能的情況。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我同樣不建議你們獨自行動，在我們確定那位想搶奪國劍的人徹底放棄計劃之前，你們最好......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "最好躲在地下的夾層裡當懦夫？得了吧！我們能應付那些鬼鬼祟祟的傢伙們！現在，最重要的是——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "夠了，因陀羅。"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "我......\n好吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "針對特雷西斯的行動會在什麼時候開始？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不會太快，我們需要偵察那些補給線的具體情況。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "碎片大廈內部的結構也需要調查。特雷西斯......很強大，任何一點鬆懈都會要了我們的命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "具體時間呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "半個月內，我希望能在碎片大廈被他真正啟動前......了結這些事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "足夠了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，我申請在這次行動之前暫時離隊。請放心，我會在任務開始時回來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "所以，你還是堅持要前往諾伯特區。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......我已經失去很多朋友了，克洛維希婭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我沒有辦法一次又一次地袖手旁觀。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這確實是個出於我個人情感的要求，我不會避諱這一點。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但與此同時，我也認為這是個機會，在我們的正式行動開始之前，解決掉一些潛藏的隱患。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......比如，那些傷害阿勒黛的人，那些想要諸王之息的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那無疑是一位大公爵，無論他接下來打算擺出什麼立場，我想......我都該和他好好“談一談”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "阿斯卡綸小姐說了，我們的時間並不充裕。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我知道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我會處理好的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......博士，你怎麼看？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "在那個地塊上，還有件值得注意的事。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......是的，薩卡茲的飛空艇很可能停靠在現在的諾伯特區中。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這也意味著......"
        },
        {
